\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 AOC urges Biden to ignore Texas ruling suspending approval of  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  drug\b0\par\par\uc2 Sam Levine \par \uc2 676 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par 16:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Democratic New York congresswoman says there is \u8216\'20\'18extraordinary precedent\u8217\'20\'19 for Biden to decline to enforce ruling\par \par \uc2 The New York congresswoman \uc2 Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez\uc2  said on Sunday there was \u8220\'20\'1Can extraordinary amount of precedent\u8221\'20\'1D for the Joe Biden White House to ignore a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/07/abortion-pill-ruling-mifepristone-trump-judge-matthew-kacsmaryk#:~:text=A%20federal%20judge%20in%20Texas,brought%20by%20anti%2Dabortion%20activists."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Friday court ruling}}}\uc2  suspending federal approval of a drug used in medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Those remarks from the Democratic US House member quickly prompted a threat by the Texas Republican congressman Tony Gonzales to defund certain programs under the federal agency which oversees medication approvals if Biden\u8217\'20\'19s administration did as Ocasio-Cortez suggested.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration has already said it plans to appeal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/07/abortion-pill-ruling-mifepristone-trump-judge-matthew-kacsmaryk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Friday ruling}}}\uc2  from Texas-based federal judge Matthew Kacsmaryk, a conservative appointed by the Donald Trump White House, that blocked the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s (\uc2 FDA\uc2 ) approval of the drug mifepristone. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  approved the drug in 2000, a move that is now being challenged by the \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2 , a conservative Christian legal group.\par \par \uc2 In urging the Biden administration to decline to enforce the ruling, Ocasio-Cortez noted that the Trump administration had ignored court rulings on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2020/07/15/891563635/trump-administration-rejects-1st-time-daca-applications-violates-scotus-order#:~:text=Press-,Despite%20Supreme%20Court's%20Ruling%20On%20DACA%2C%20Trump%20Administration%20Rejects%20New,last%20month's%20Supreme%20Court%20order."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immigration issues}}}\uc2 . She also pointed out that there was a contradicting ruling from a federal judge in Washington state on Friday which blocked the \uc2 FDA\uc2  from taking any action to limit access to the drug, virtually ensuring that the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  would settle the matter at some point.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is an extraordinary amount of precedent for this \u8230\'20\'26 The Trump administration also did this very thing. This has happened before,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mediaite.com/news/that-is-a-stunning-position-cnns-dana-bash-confronts-aoc-on-telling-biden-to-ignore-abortion-pill-ruling/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 she said}}}\uc2  during an appearance on CNN\u8217\'20\'19s State of the Union.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe courts rely on the legitimacy of their rulings. And when they make a mockery of our system, a mockery of our democracy and a mockery of our law, as what we just saw happen in this mifepristone ruling, then I believe that the executive branch, and we know that the executive branch has enforcement discretion, especially in light of a contradicting ruling coming out of Washington.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 CNN host Dana Bash said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/alexandria-ocasio-cortez"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ocasio-Cortez}}}\uc2  was offering a \u8220\'20\'1Cpretty stunning position\u8221\'20\'1D and pressed the congresswoman on whether the Biden administration should ignore the ruling if the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  eventually upheld Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s decision.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think one of the things that we need to examine is the grounds of that ruling,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CBut I do not believe that the courts have the authority \u8230\'20\'26 over the \uc2 FDA\uc2  that [Kacsmaryk] just asserted. And I do believe that it creates a crisis. Should the supreme court do that, it would essentially institute a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 During a later appearance on State of the Union, Gonzales told Bash that there would be consequences if the Biden administration ignored the ruling.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe House Republicans have the power of the purse,\u8221\'20\'1D Gonzales said. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd if the administration wants to not live up to this ruling, then we\u8217\'20\'19re gonna have a problem. And it may become a point where House Republicans on the appropriations side have to defund \uc2 FDA\uc2  programs that don\u8217\'20\'19t make sense.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Rep. Tony Gonzales (R-TX) reacts to the Biden administration's plan after a federal judge issued a ruling that could prevent access to a medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drug. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNNSotu?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CNNSotu}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/CNNSOTU?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #CNNSOTU}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/5ReUzxcA2h"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/5ReUzxcA2h}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 CNN (@CNN) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNN/status/1645065265984557057?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 9, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Bash also asked the secretary of the US Department of Health and Human Services, \uc2 Xavier Becerra\uc2 , whether ignoring the ruling was \u8220\'20\'1Coff the table\u8221\'20\'1D. Becerra declined to say specifically what the administration would do if appellate courts, including the supreme court, upheld the decision.\par \par \uc2 "We want the courts to overturn this reckless decision."\par \par \uc2 US Health and Human Services Secretary \uc2 Xavier Becerra\uc2  explains the Biden administration's plan after a federal judge issued a ruling that could prevent access to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -inducing medication. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNNSotu?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CNNSotu}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/CNNSOTU?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #CNNSOTU}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HnJi5J5M90"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HnJi5J5M90}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 CNN (@CNN) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNN/status/1645055147419095041?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 9, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEverything is on the table,\u8221\'20\'1D he said on CNN. \u8220\'20\'1CWe want the courts to overturn this reckless decision.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230409ej4900131\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
