\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Not going to let our military be politicised,\u8217\'20\'19 says Republican delaying nominees over  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in New York \par \uc2 650 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 March 2023\par 05:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Defense secretary \uc2 Lloyd Austin\uc2  asks Tommy Tuberville of Alabama to lift \u8216\'20\'18hold\u8217\'20\'19, while Democrat \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2  issues firm rebuke\par \par \uc2 A Republican senator holding up more than 100 nominations over Pentagon policy on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  claimed: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m not going to let our military be politicised.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tommy Tuberville, from Alabama, was speaking on Tuesday at a hearing staged by the armed services committee.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Department of Defense\uc2  covers expenses and leave needs for troops who have to travel to obtain an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a procedure it allows in cases of rape or incest or if the health of the mother is in danger.\par \par \uc2 In protest of that policy, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.defense.gov/News/Releases/Release/Article/3301006/dod-releases-policies-to-ensure-access-to-non-covered-reproductive-health-care/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  last October, Tuberville is objecting to the quick processing of more than 150 civilian nominees and senior officer promotions.\par \par \uc2 Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Chold\u8221\'20\'1D means each nomination or promotion must be voted on individually, rather than in time-saving batches.\par \par \uc2 At the Tuesday hearing, the defense secretary, \uc2 Lloyd Austin\uc2 , said the delay could affect readiness to fight.\par \par \uc2 Citing threats from Russia, China and Iran, the retired general said: \u8220\'20\'1CThere are a number of things happening globally that indicate that we could be in a contest on any one given day.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNot approving the recommendations for promotions actually creates a ripple effect through the force that makes us far less ready than we need to be.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe effects are cumulative and it will affect families. It will affect kids going to schools because they won\u8217\'20\'19t be able to change their duty station. It\u8217\'20\'19s a powerful effect and will impact on our readiness.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Austin said: \u8220\'20\'1CI really implore you to reconsider and allow our nominations to move forward. It will make a significant difference for our force.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Republicans scored a longed-for victory last year, when the conservative-dominated supreme court overturned the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was protected for 49 years.\par \par \uc2 Democrats seized on a potent campaign issue but the decision emboldened conservative states to pass draconian bans.\par \par \uc2 Austin said: \u8220\'20\'1CAlmost one in five of our troops is women. And they don\u8217\'20\'19t get a chance to choose where they\u8217\'20\'19re stationed. So almost 80,000 of our women are stationed in places where they don\u8217\'20\'19t have access to non-covered reproductive healthcare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tuberville said: \u8220\'20\'1CNow my colleagues on the left think this \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue is good for a campaign, and that\u8217\'20\'19s what this shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be about. I\u8217\'20\'19m not going to let our military be politicised.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He also said: \u8220\'20\'1CI want to be clear on this: my hold has nothing to do with the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s decision to the access of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This is about not forcing the taxpayers of this country to fund abortions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Monday, 36 Senate Democrats and two independents \u8211\'20\'13 Bernie Sanders of Vermont and Angus King of Maine \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.shaheen.senate.gov/imo/media/doc/letter_to_dod_on_access_to_abortion.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent an open letter}}}\uc2  to Austin, asking him to stand firm.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions and bans only force service members to travel farther to states that have not restricted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D the senators wrote, \u8220\'20\'1Cfurther compromising both the financial security of the service members and military readiness.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur service members should not be forced to needlessly risk their personal health and safety for routine healthcare simply because they pledged to protect and defend our nation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2 , the New York Democrat and Senate majority leader, rebuked Tuberville directly. The Republican, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.democrats.senate.gov/news/press-releases/majority-leader-schumer-floor-remarks-calling-on-republican-senator-tuberville-to-stop-endangering-national-security-by-holding-up-160-military-promotions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Schumer said}}}\uc2 , risked \u8220\'20\'1Cpermanently politicising the confirmation of military personnel.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\u8230\'20\'26 I can\u8217\'20\'19t think of a worse time for a [pro-Trump] Republican to pull a stunt like this, as threats against American security and against democracy are growing all around the world.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI urge members of his own party to prevail on the senator from Alabama to stand down in this unprecedented and dangerous move and allow these critical, nonpolitical, nonpartisan military nominees to go through.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230329ej3t000bf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
FF
