\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Lauren Boebert\uc2  will be a grandmother at 36. This is what conservatives want for us\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,255 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 March 2023\par 14:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t need to be said in 2023, but forcing teenagers to become parents isn\u8217\'20\'19t good for the teenagers, the baby or society in general\par \par \uc2 Boebert\u8217\'20\'19s rural family values\par \par \uc2 Congratulations to Republican congresswoman \uc2 Lauren Boebert\uc2  who is becoming a grandma at the tender age of 36. Speaking at a Conservative Political Action Conference (CPAC) Moms for America event on Tuesday, the Colorado congresswoman shared the news that her 17-year-old son is expecting a baby with his teenage girlfriend in April.\par \par \uc2 Boebert is famous for her far-right views and for stunts like putting out an advert explaining why she\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/colorado/news/lauren-boebert-video-explains-why-carrying-glock-congress/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 going to carry a gun in Congress}}}\uc2 . In 2021 she also posted an infamous {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/08/aoc-republicans-gun-christmas-photos-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Christmas card photo}}}\uc2  of her four sons, two of whom are very young, brandishing rifles in front of a Christmas tree. She is, in short, an incorrigible attention-seeker who spends more time stoking culture wars than she does {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coloradonewsline.com/2021/09/29/10-ways-lauren-boebert-has-failed-coloradans/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 producing legislation}}}\uc2 . That said, she and her children are obviously entitled to a private life. I want to stress that the only reason her growing family is at all newsworthy is because Boebert decided to turn a private affair into a big public statement about how the rest of us should live.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at the CPAC event, the extremely anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Boebert said that her biggest fear was whether her son and his partner \u8220\'20\'1Cwould choose life\u8221\'20\'1D. When they did, she was so proud that she decided to turn them into a parable about rural family values.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s something special about rural conservative communities,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.salon.com/2023/03/09/lauren-boebert-trashes-ed--then-announces-teen-son-is-making-her-a-36-year-old-grandmother/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Boebert effused}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThey value life. If you look at teen pregnancy rates throughout the nation, well, they\u8217\'20\'19re the same, [in] rural and urban areas. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates are higher in urban areas. Teen moms\u8217\'20\'19 rates are higher in rural conservative areas, because they understand the preciousness of a life that it\u8217\'20\'19s about to be born.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Well, perhaps that\u8217\'20\'19s one reason teenage mothers are more prevalent in rural areas. Perhaps another reason is that the teenage girls are unable to access a safe and legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and are forced to give birth when they\u8217\'20\'19re unprepared to be parents. Even before Roe v Wade was overturned it was difficult and expensive for rural Americans to access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services. According to data analyzed by the pro-choice \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , for example, 20% of US women in 2014 already had to travel at least 42 miles to access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services. Meanwhile women living in rural counties in Montana, Texas, Wyoming, North Dakota, South Dakota, Nebraska and Kansas {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/4967735/how-far-american-women-travel-for-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had to travel more than 180 miles}}}\uc2 . Now that Roe has been overturned, Bloomberg estimates that Americans in 26 states will have to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/graphics/2022-supreme-court-abortion-travel/#xj4y7vzkg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 travel 552 miles to get an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  Five hundred and fifty-two miles!\par \par \uc2 This shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t need to be said in 2023, but forcing teenagers to become parents isn\u8217\'20\'19t good for the teenagers, the baby or society in general. Far too often it means the mother having to give up her education. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cdc.gov/teenpregnancy/about/index.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According to the CDC}}}\uc2 , for example, \u8220\'20\'1COnly about 50% of teen mothers receive a high school diploma by 22 years of age, whereas approximately 90% of women who do not give birth during adolescence graduate from high school.\u8221\'20\'1D Boebert herself became a mum when she was 17 and ended up dropping out of high school. The CDC also notes that the \u8220\'20\'1Cchildren of teenage mothers are more likely to have lower school achievement and to drop out of high school, have more health problems, be incarcerated at some time during adolescence, give birth as a teenager, and face unemployment as a young adult\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one way to reduce teenage pregnancies. Quality sexual health education in schools is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cdc.gov/healthyyouth/whatworks/what-works-sexual-health-education.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 another}}}\uc2 . Boebert, of course, is against both. At another CPAC event, Boebert said she wants to cut funding for \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.alternet.org/lauren-boebert-comprehensive-ed/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comprehensive sex ed}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D, stating it shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be taught to \u8220\'20\'1Cany student in a public school\u8221\'20\'1D. She\u8217\'20\'19s obviously not the only Republican with this view, conservatives have been increasingly attacking sexual education in schools in recent years and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msnbc.com/opinion/msnbc-opinion/sex-education-belongs-schools-republicans-want-it-out-n1295332"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushing abstinence-only programs}}}\uc2 . It won\u8217\'20\'19t surprise you to hear that a wealth of evidence shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.publichealth.columbia.edu/public-health-now/news/abstinence-only-education-failure#:~:text=%E2%80%9CWhile%20abstinence%20is%20theoretically%20effective,pregnancies%20or%20sexually%20transmitted%20diseases.%E2%80%9D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abstinence-only programs don\u8217\'20\'19t work}}}\uc2 . Rather, they\u8217\'20\'19re a great way to generate a lot more 36-year-old grandmothers.\par \par \uc2 Only 14 countries have full equal rights for women, says \uc2 World Bank\uc2  Report\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.weforum.org/agenda/2023/03/only-14-countries-have-full-equal-rights-for-women/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Those countries}}}\uc2  ? Belgium, Canada, Denmark, France, Greece, Iceland, Ireland, Latvia, Luxembourg, Portugal, Spain, Sweden, Germany and the Netherlands. The US, meanwhile, ranks below countries like Peru and Albania. That\u8217\'20\'19s largely because of laws around parental leave, equal pay and equal pensions.\par \par \uc2 Artwork referring to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  removed from Idaho public college exhibition\par \par \uc2 This censorship is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/mar/07/idaho-college-abortion-artwork-banned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brought to you by the same people}}}\uc2  who like to talk about \u8220\'20\'1Ccancel culture\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cfree speech\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Shania Twain says the country music industry has regressed for women artists\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs I went along, I could see the progress,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/10/shania-twain-country-music-industry-has-regressed-for-women-artists.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twain told CNBC}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CBut I feel that since then, the industry has regressed, I feel it\u8217\'20\'19s more difficult for women to find space to find room.\u8221\'20\'1D Twain said there were fewer female artists emerging in country music than before.\par \par \uc2 Honduras\u8217\'20\'19s first female leader legalizes morning-after pill\par \par \uc2 President \uc2 Xiomara Castro\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bbc.com/news/world-latin-america-64908816"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned a 13-year ban}}}\uc2  on the emergency contraceptive via executive order.\par \par \uc2 Biden administration grants US visa to extremist Israeli minister who called for a Palestinian town to be wiped out\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think the village of Hawara needs to be wiped out,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Bezalel Smotrich\uc2  said after mobs of Israeli settlers attacked the Palestinian town two weeks ago in what one Israeli military commander {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.sky.com/story/west-bank-violence-in-palestinian-town-described-as-a-pogrom-by-israeli-military-commander-12822393"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called a \u8220\'20\'1Cpogrom\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CI think the state of Israel should do it,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. After he said all that the Biden administration is still allowing him into the country. Just another example of how Palestinian lives simply do not matter to the US.\par \par \uc2 Catholic group spent millions on app data that tracked gay priests\par \par \uc2 Expect a lot more of this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/dc-md-va/2023/03/09/catholics-gay-priests-grindr-data-bishops/?mc_cid=35d6a8289b&mc_eid=8ce16ced76"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sort of surveillance in the future}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Thousands of Iranian schoolgirls appear to have suffered \u8216\'20\'18mild poison\u8217\'20\'19 attacks\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/mar/06/what-do-we-know-suspected-poisonings-schoolgirls-iran"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not entirely clear what is happening}}}\uc2  or who is behind the attacks but there are suspicions that extremists may be trying to stop girls getting an education. Meanwhile officials from Iran\u8217\'20\'19s education department blame \u8220\'20\'1Cmass hysteria\u8221\'20\'1D. On Tuesday Iran {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/mar/07/iran-makes-first-arrests-over-suspected-schoolgirl-poisonings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced the first arrests}}}\uc2  in connection to the poisonings but didn\u8217\'20\'19t give any details about the suspects.\par \par \uc2 Berlin to let women swim topless at public swimming pools\par \par \uc2 This {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/travel/europe/germany/berlin/berlin-topless-swimming-pools-equality-law-b2297959.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comes after legal action by a woman}}}\uc2  who was kicked out of an open-air pool for sunbathing topless and argued it was a form of discrimination since men can be topless.\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 Last week saw news about \u8220\'20\'1Cnarco cat\u8221\'20\'1D: a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2023/03/03/narco-cat-tattoo-mexican-prison/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tattooed hairless cat}}}\uc2  that was rescued from a Mexican prison. This week \u8220\'20\'1Ccocaine cat\u8221\'20\'1D is making headlines. An African serval cat leapt out of a car in Cincinnati and escaped after its unscrupulous owner was pulled over at a traffic stop. After the cat was captured, cocaine was found in its system. Now it\u8217\'20\'19s going to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2023/03/09/1162317306/cocaine-cat-cincinnati-zoo-serval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 live at the Cincinnati Zoo}}}\uc2 . Officials are apparently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2023/03/09/1162317306/cocaine-cat-cincinnati-zoo-serva"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not pursuing charges}}}\uc2  against the owner despite the fact the person had a wild animal and let it ingest cocaine. I guess the US police need to conserve their resources to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.com/police-getting-help-social-media-to-prosecute-people-seeking-abortions-2023-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lock up women}}}\uc2  having abortions instead.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230311ej3b001me\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
