\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Congresswoman shares story of stillborn son with US House\b0\par\par\uc2 Poppy Noor \par \uc2 1,092 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 January 2023\par 16:19 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Florida\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Frederica Wilson\uc2  relives experience of being forced to carry a dead baby as Republicans push for anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures\par \par \uc2 It was a moment of raw humanity in Washington amid federal policy discussions that were largely devoid of it.\par \par \uc2 During a week when Republicans, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jan/07/kevin-mccarthy-republican-house-speaker-congress"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newly in control}}}\uc2  of the House of Representatives, discussed whether pharmacy workers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jan/11/new-abortion-restrictions-bills-republicans-house-congress"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 should be allowed}}}\uc2  to refuse to fill \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication prescriptions due to religious objections, the Florida congresswoman \uc2 Frederica Wilson\uc2  rose to break a silence she had held.\par \par \uc2 At 80 years old, she was finally ready to tell publicly her own \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  story.\par \par \uc2 Speaking on the House floor, she said: \u8220\'20\'1CAll I ever wanted since I was a little girl was plenty of children that I could love and cuddle and raise to greatness.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAfter getting married in 1968, I would soon become a mother-to-be. It was the joy of my life, I was ecstatic. My husband was walking on the clouds \u8230\'20\'26 [We] would touch my stomach all the time just to feel the movement of our baby boy and the glory of a life growing inside of me,\u8221\'20\'1D she told those in the chamber.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThen at seven months the baby stopped moving. He was soon pronounced dead \u8211\'20\'13 right inside of my womb \u8211\'20\'13 and the doctor was prohibited by law from inducing labor,\u8221\'20\'1D she explained.\par \par \uc2 Today, I relived one of the most painful times in my life on the House floor. I shared my experience of being forced to carry my dead baby. Prohibited by law to induce labor, I carried my deceased child inside me for two months and almost died. We can't go back. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/emuWzQDgWX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/emuWzQDgWX}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Rep. \uc2 Frederica Wilson\uc2  (@RepWilson) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RepWilson/status/1613246407137189901?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Her experience took place five years before the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was secured through the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  ruling in January 1973 \u8211\'20\'13 a decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dismantled by}}}\uc2  the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2022/aug/02/us-supreme-court-liberal-justices-dissents-resistance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conservative-controlled}}}\uc2  court last June.\par \par \uc2 During her evocative speech on Wednesday, Wilson said she had previously been loth to speak of her personal experiences as part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights debate, not wanting \u8220\'20\'1Cto relive the most painful time in my entire life\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 But she said a statistic about Florida made her want to come forward.\par \par \uc2 The research she appeared to be citing showed that, if \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended up being banned nationwide, Florida would have the worst maternal death rate in the country, alongside Georgia, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://osf.io/preprints/socarxiv/7g29k/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing by 29%}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In line with the national trend, a disproportionate number of those women will be Black and Hispanic \u8211\'20\'13 about 39% nationally, the same research suggests. Wilson is a member of the Congressional Black Caucus and represents a district including part of Miami. Florida is debating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/dec/13/abortion-restrictions-us-state-legislatures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whether to tighten}}}\uc2  further its current 15-week limit for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 During her rousing speech, Wilson talked about the pain, grief and terror that came alongside waiting to deliver a stillborn child at a time when she couldn\u8217\'20\'19t receive an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI cried every night and all day,\u8221\'20\'1D said the congresswoman. \u8220\'20\'1CMy little body was wretched with pain, weakness and frailty. I lost 50 pounds. I would crawl into a fetal position in my mother\u8217\'20\'19s lap most of the day, and my husband\u8217\'20\'19s most of the night.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She went on to detail her experience delivering at eight and a half months, and the moments of panic in between, where she was warned that housing a disintegrating fetal corpse inside her body could lead to any manner of complications, such as toxic shock syndrome.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAfter three days I left the maternity ward in a wheelchair, empty-handed, no baby, no nothing. I watched all of the mothers and families celebrate their newborns while I grieved and cried,\u8221\'20\'1D said Wilson.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe had a small graveside burial for baby boy Wilson and doctors were so worried that I would also have to have a graveside burial,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 I was wheeled out of the maternity ward empty-handed and overcome with grief as I watched other moms celebrate their newborns.\par \par \uc2 Abortions don't just apply to women who've decided they are not ready to have a child. It affects women who are faced with medical emergencies. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/n6n1w81xgm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/n6n1w81xgm}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Rep. \uc2 Frederica Wilson\uc2  (@RepWilson) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RepWilson/status/1613246411046281241?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Then addressing Republican lawmakers who aspire to legislate against reproductive rights, she added: \u8220\'20\'1CDo not take us back to the days before Roe v Wade.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 House Republicans have almost no hope of getting any radical anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  legislation past the Democratic-controlled \uc2 US Senate\uc2 , but that is unlikely to dampen their posturing.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in the 49 years since Roe v Wade, the Democrats never codified the rights afforded by the case in federal legislation. The fall of Roe means the power to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights or pass bans or hefty restrictions has returned to the individual states.\par \par \uc2 The Democratic Women\u8217\'20\'19s Caucus, a group of members of Congress, tweeted: \u8220\'20\'1COur Caucus dressed in white today to show our collective resistance to the extreme MAGA Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  agenda. We will always stand up for reproductive freedom & access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Our Caucus dressed in white today to show our collective resistance to the extreme MAGA Republicans' anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  agenda.\par \par \uc2 We will always stand up for reproductive freedom & access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/zVx0kDIsYj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/zVx0kDIsYj}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Democratic Women's Caucus (@DemWomenCaucus) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DemWomenCaucus/status/1613319780928466949?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Wilson is more widely known outside congressional circles for her vivid suits and large, brightly-colored and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.essence.com/fashion/black-congresswomen-frederica-wilson-colorful-hats/#90637"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bedazzled cowboy hats}}}\uc2 , but on Wednesday her charisma and flamboyance were channeled into bitter testimony and a plea to the right.\par \par \uc2 She ended her speech by lamenting the many \u8211\'20\'13 mostly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/may/14/alabama-abortion-ban-white-men-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 male}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 politicians within the Republican party\u8217\'20\'19s dogged attempts to undo \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  protections for women in America.\par \par \uc2 We cannot put childbearing women at risk because of a group of ludicrous, hateful, majority-male Congress who have never experienced pregnancy or childbirth but take pride in monitoring women's vaginas. How dare you! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/xUKrxvvbzX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/xUKrxvvbzX}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Rep. \uc2 Frederica Wilson\uc2  (@RepWilson) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RepWilson/status/1613246415031128064?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou cannot put young, child-bearing women at risk because of the group of ludicrous, hateful majority-male congressmen who have no idea what it feels like to even bear the pain of childbirth or even have the courage to carry a child for nine months, who take pride in monitoring women\u8217\'20\'19s vaginas. How dare you?\u8221\'20\'1D she asked.\par \par \uc2 She concluded: \u8220\'20\'1CMay God help you find it in your heart to hear my story.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230116ej1g002ck\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
